  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the centrality of protection and protection programming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to review and strengthen how NRC seeks to achieve protection. This will be achieved through the following approaches: Safe programming, Integrated programming, Advocacy and coordination and Standalone programming.</narrative>
